  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Reverse Flow River, Fang Yuan builds an immortal killer move on Myriad Self while under siege, and names that work Myriad Self Second Style. Perseverance Gu and Pulling Water are the basis, with water path mortal Gu bridging the two Immortal Gu cores.",
      "chapters": [
        1287
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_reverse_flow_river",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "move_myriad_self",
        "move_myriad_self_second_style",
        "gu_perseverance_gu",
        "gu_pulling_water",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the move finally activates, it is Immortal killer move Myriad Self Second Style, Reverse Flow Protection Seal.",
      "chapters": [
        1289
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The entirety of Reverse Flow River glows blue, then shrinks into a tiny dot and becomes a light blue white robe on Fang Yuan, with slow flowing water on its surface and a deep azure sash coiled around his arms, neck, and waist. Old Ancestor Xue Hu’s icy light is fully blocked, then reflected back at its creator. Mao Li Qiu’s claw strike sends Fang Yuan flying, yet he stands up unharmed while the ferret’s right paw is bloody and exposed; later volleys keep reflecting onto Mao Li Qiu itself. Fang Yuan notes that this Myriad Self Second Style involves too many Gu worms of different types, so a concise version would need years of deduction or higher attainment. Narration then states that for the last few thousand years Feng Jiu Ge alone could battle rank eight existences, and that Fang Yuan now shares that standing with him.",
      "chapters": [
        1289
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "activation-and-reflection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu",
        "char_mao_li_qiu",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later judges that if he had not refined perseverance Gu and created reverse flow protection seal, he would likely have lost the Reverse Flow River battle and fallen into Ying Wu Xie’s trap. Narration places his battle strength level with the strongest below rank eight and on par with Feng Jiu Ge.",
      "chapters": [
        1292
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "judgment-after-the-river-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_wu_xie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With reverse flow protection seal active Fang Yuan’s offense stays weaker than Feng Jiu Ge’s, yet he can hold his own against him.",
      "chapters": [
        1317
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "offense-still-weaker-than-feng-jiu-ge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ready to go kill Lady White Rabbit himself, Fang Yuan checks the impulse: reverse flow protection seal could stop a rank eight existence, but drawing on it here would expose the identity behind his Wu Yi Hai face to a possibly watching Purple Mountain True Monarch, so he stays hidden instead.",
      "chapters": [
        1349
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "held-back-to-avoid-exposure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_white_rabbit",
        "char_wu_yi_hai",
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Wu Yong secretly strikes at Fang Yuan’s physical body through his captured life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu, reverse flow protection seal reflects the killer move completely back onto Wu Yong, who coughs blood from the backlash.",
      "chapters": [
        1383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "remote-attack-turned-back",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong",
        "gu_soul_lantern_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reverse flow protection seal turns Wu Yong’s finger wind dragon around to crash into his own Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building, and reflects the effect of air lock on Fang Yuan back onto Wu Yong, who is inside that building and is simply not affected, while the upper extreme heavenly eagle stays plagued by it.",
      "chapters": [
        1387
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "finger-wind-dragon-and-air-lock-reflected",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_clear_jade_dripping_wind_tiny_bamboo_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong sends the wind blades out by manipulating his battlefield killer move four clear transforming winds, so he is not the direct attacker, and reverse flow protection seal, which reflects an attack back at its attacker, can only send the blades back at the battlefield itself and not at Wu Yong.",
      "chapters": [
        1390
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reflection-targets-the-direct-attacker",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Maintaining reverse flow protection seal takes most of Fang Yuan’s attention, so he cannot activate strength path giant hand and can only transform his arms into dragon arms and claws, covered in dragon scales, boosted by rank seven dragon strength Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1391
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "giant-hand-blocked-by-upkeep",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_dragon_strength_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Unable to break through reverse flow protection seal, Feng Jiu Ge judges that sustaining it costs Fang Yuan too much mental energy to use movement or other killer moves, leaving him ordinary in everything but defense while it is active.",
      "chapters": [
        1425
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feng-jiu-ges-assessment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Feng Jiu Ge unleashes Heavenly Court’s chaotic heart drumming sound, reverse flow protection seal reflects most of its effect, but a small part still penetrates and reaches Fang Yuan, who reads it as a sign Heavenly Court has made some gains in deciphering the seal.",
      "chapters": [
        1426
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "partial-breach",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    }
  ],
